| !Run for !ROBench: CPU, memory, OS, file and graphics benchmark.
| Runs single-tasking (as games do) so other tasks don't disturb the
| timing, then opens the results file. Takes about 15 minutes.
|
| Copyright (c) 2026 Andrew Youll. MIT licence (see LICENSE).
Set ROBench$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <ROBench$Dir>.!Sprites
RMEnsure UtilityModule 5.00 Error ROBench needs RISC OS 5
RMEnsure VFPSupport 0 Error ROBench needs the VFPSupport module (RISC OS 5 on an ARMv7 or later processor)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error ROBench needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error ROBench needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 4096K -max 4096K
CDir <ROBench$Dir>.Results
| robench sets ROBench$Last to the results file; BasicBench adds to it
<ROBench$Dir>.robench -g -o <ROBench$Dir>.Results.R%%T %*0
Set ROBench$Basic BASIC
BASIC -quit <ROBench$Dir>.BasicBench
Set ROBench$Basic BASIC64
RMEnsure BASICVFP 0 Set ROBench$Basic none
If "<ROBench$Basic>"="BASIC64" Then BASIC64 -quit <ROBench$Dir>.BasicBench
Unset ROBench$Basic
If "<ROBench$Last>"<>"" Then Filer_Run <ROBench$Last>
